# CLAUDE.local.md (template)

This file is local-only. Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md` for personal notes.

Allowed
- Local paths, notes, TODOs
- Local URLs (localhost endpoints)
- Preferred commands and aliases

Forbidden
- Secrets, API keys, tokens, passwords
- Production IPs or credentials

Example
- Working dir: /home/user/Projects/octavios-chat-bajaware_invex
- Preferred: /dev-up --start then make test T=api
